1
00:00:05,679 --> 00:00:09,409
Welcome to AMAI, the Adaptive Micro-Assembly Inspector.

2
00:00:09,409 --> 00:00:14,563
AMAI is a Physical AI quality assurance and robotic sorting system built for

3
00:00:14,563 --> 00:00:17,343
high-precision electronics manufacturing.

4
00:00:20,369 --> 00:00:22,466
Let's inspect a micro-assembly unit.

5
00:00:22,466 --> 00:00:26,777
We trigger an inspection of a circuit board with an injected solder bridge

6
00:00:26,777 --> 00:00:27,185
defect.

7
00:00:31,479 --> 00:00:33,190
24 milliseconds.

8
00:00:33,190 --> 00:00:40,994
The system computes the 2D bounding box and projects it into 3D Cartesian

9
00:00:40,994 --> 00:00:45,591
coordinates to plan a collision-free grasp.

10
00:00:48,567 --> 00:00:51,103
Switching to the calibrated depth field

11
00:00:51,103 --> 00:00:56,109
our overhead depth map verifies sub-millimeter clearance heights and protects

12
00:00:56,109 --> 00:00:57,279
sensitive silicon.

13
00:01:01,909 --> 00:01:03,725
Now let's test a nominal board.

14
00:01:03,725 --> 00:01:07,885
We switch back to the perception view and inspect a pristine pass unit.

15
00:01:13,853 --> 00:01:16,582
With Speechmatics streaming voice oversight

16
00:01:16,582 --> 00:01:20,137
operators on the factory floor can supervise hands-free.

17
00:01:20,137 --> 00:01:24,389
Watch as we trigger a voice override to approve a unit to assembly.

18
00:01:29,236 --> 00:01:32,023
Every inspection result, 3D coordinate

19
00:01:32,023 --> 00:01:37,744
and operator voice transcript is logged to an immutable SQLite audit trail for

20
00:01:37,744 --> 00:01:39,358
full ISO traceability.

21
00:01:39,358 --> 00:01:43,612
AMAI brings real-time Physical AI to modern manufacturing.
